{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One Last Sacrifice is an auto battler with meta progression. Build a  deck of creatures across multiple battles. Craft them with Path of Exile-inspired modifiers. Unlock skills in a branching skill\u00a0 tree that shapes your playstyle. Six factions, 70+ creatures, and a perk system that makes every match play differently. Fight 1v1 duels or 8-player elimination tournaments - sync or async.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/6f17b066b24bf469444613c13737a82d.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your jar is your deck, a collection of creatures that carries between matches. Build it through rituals, or adapt mid-combat by buying from the Vein, a rotating shop that refreshes each round. Craft your creatures with Path of Exile-inspired modifiers to push them beyond their base power. But even your best fighters won't last forever: every creature has stability, and each time you field one, it wears down. When it hits zero, it's gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=752 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.mp4?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/5c62274a69704d8ac9da826af89b98d9.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factions. No fairies. No dragons. Each with their own creatures, synergies, and mechanics. Bloodthirsty imps, soul-trapping assassins, hive-minded gel creatures. Build around one faction or  mix and match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/961f31d9947dd945a08956724662c1a5.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/961f31d9947dd945a08956724662c1a5.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/9286bd0465f98707793862756e94fdbc.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience and grow in power, new skills become available. They allow you to tailor the experience of combat to your liking. Yet the Arena's Crowd is never still, hungry for spectacle. Each match starts with a random perk that changes the rules - maybe all creatures deal +50% damage, double trigger on death effects or a boost to your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/419a2ff66e0ec9c1b5110c9c6f1a60a4.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=752 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/419a2ff66e0ec9c1b5110c9c6f1a60a4.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/de60c4c7f0c767f6c4a64596da1b9eaf.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of <strong>three classes</strong> and carve your path through the  skill tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim <strong>Notable Skills</strong> for sudden surges of power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Skills</strong> add new abilities to use in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C<strong>onvictions</strong>\u00a0rewrite the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn more in the wiki</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to go deeper? Check out the wiki in the sidebar for the full breakdown of factions, creatures, crafting, and more.<br><strong>--&gt; &quot;View the manual&quot;</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4019040?t=1773073122","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/8a58b4522ba0ad060a381a22489a3aa279dc13a4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773073122","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/d3c37f391795dc973e7d8f46cef5478a064b8371/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773073122","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/d3c37f391795dc973e7d8f46cef5478a064b8371/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773073122","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"One Last Sacrifice includes fantasy violence and pixel gore"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One Last Sacrifice is an auto battler with meta progression. Build a  deck of creatures across multiple battles. Craft them with Path of Exile-inspired modifiers. Unlock skills in a branching skill\u00a0 tree that shapes your playstyle. Six factions, 70+ creatures, and a perk system that makes every match play differently. Fight 1v1 duels or 8-player elimination tournaments - sync or async.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/6f17b066b24bf469444613c13737a82d.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your jar is your deck, a collection of creatures that carries between matches. Build it through rituals, or adapt mid-combat by buying from the Vein, a rotating shop that refreshes each round. Craft your creatures with Path of Exile-inspired modifiers to push them beyond their base power. But even your best fighters won't last forever: every creature has stability, and each time you field one, it wears down. When it hits zero, it's gone for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=752 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/e970569d06faf7106895e36e66d3d6e8.mp4?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/5c62274a69704d8ac9da826af89b98d9.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factions. No fairies. No dragons. Each with their own creatures, synergies, and mechanics. Bloodthirsty imps, soul-trapping assassins, hive-minded gel creatures. Build around one faction or  mix and match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/961f31d9947dd945a08956724662c1a5.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/961f31d9947dd945a08956724662c1a5.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/9286bd0465f98707793862756e94fdbc.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain experience and grow in power, new skills become available. They allow you to tailor the experience of combat to your liking. Yet the Arena's Crowd is never still, hungry for spectacle. Each match starts with a random perk that changes the rules - maybe all creatures deal +50% damage, double trigger on death effects or a boost to your economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/419a2ff66e0ec9c1b5110c9c6f1a60a4.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=752 height=423 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/419a2ff66e0ec9c1b5110c9c6f1a60a4.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/de60c4c7f0c767f6c4a64596da1b9eaf.avif?t=1773073122\" width=500 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick one of <strong>three classes</strong> and carve your path through the  skill tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim <strong>Notable Skills</strong> for sudden surges of power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Skills</strong> add new abilities to use in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C<strong>onvictions</strong>\u00a0rewrite the rules entirely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.poster.avif?t=1773073122\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/extras/fc3e14a45b8f32f60be3e0aa87d3eb2d.webm?t=1773073122\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn more in the wiki</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to go deeper? Check out the wiki in the sidebar for the full breakdown of factions, creatures, crafting, and more.<br><strong>--&gt; &quot;View the manual&quot;</strong></p>","developers":["MegaMaw Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4019040/d7d69c8b15b01507a568a4ada45746bc8b92173a/header.jpg?t=1773073122","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel i5-6200U or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphics 520 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 7520U or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  Intel HD Graphics 520 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomm